    "text": "<p>Consider the cell&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pt</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>latm</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>aq</mi><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8739;</mo><mo>Pt</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>771</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>/</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>If the potential of the cell is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>712</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> the ratio of concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is<br />(Nearest integer)</p>"
