  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Cell reaction which occurs:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mtext>&#160;(aq.)&#160;</mtext><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mtext>&#160;(aq.)&#160;</mtext></math><br />Using Nernst&#39; equation:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>712</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>771</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>771</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0712</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mr